  data: {
    LLM: 'Reach the agreed target score (typically 1000 or 1500) by combining meld points and trick points. Bid to name trump; the bidding team must make at least their bid (meld plus trick points) or be set.\n\nDeal 12 cards each. Auction: players bid in turn; high bidder declares trump. All players meld (runs, marriages, pinochles, arounds); points counted. High bidder leads; follow suit if possible, must trump if void; identical cards rank first-played. Trick points plus meld must meet or exceed the bid for the bidding team. First partnership to reach target wins.',
